Z||000006||sloth85GT||12-04-2001||03:39 AM||||LOADS of people hate Fieros. My manager at work hated it till I gave him a ride in it and told him a little bit about it. He doesn't mind them now. They're not his favorite car, but at least he doesn't hate them anymore. Lots of other people are like that, they don't know enough about the car to appreciate it, all they hear is the bad stuff and the lies. They'll even bash a mint Fiero like West Coasts red one. I just brush these stubborn people off and say, oh well, you know nothing. <P>That Civic "racer" is a joke, it's a Civic RICER! And it's a photoshop job, a pretty good one though you have to admit. Check out these specs:<BR>AEM Cam Gear <BR>AEM Underdrive Pulleys <BR>Focuz Short Ram Intake <BR>Focuz 2" Exhaust <BR>NOS 80 shot/wet <BR>Custom Blue Pearl Subaru Paint <BR>Xenon Bodykit <BR>WingsWest Touring Spoiler <BR>18" Motegi MR7's white with 215/35ZR Parada's <P>must be good for about a 16.3 in the 1/4! WHOA! Fast car.<P>RICE!!!<P>I was hoping that the K-car Type R would get a better response when I put it up there, it's a sweet ride! But I think some of the rice boys might have been offended by it cause it kinda gives them a reality check.||||reg||1
